{"id":"wb-7-1394","name":"团山民居建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"团山村","text":"团山村是中华人民共和国云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州建水县西庄镇下辖的行政村，坐落在泸江河南岸，西面靠山，东临西庄坝子，距离建水县城约13公里，面积约58.47公顷。2012年，团山村被列入第一批中国传统村落名录。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%A2%E5%B1%B1%E6%9D%91","revisionId":95185602,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95185602","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2c388acc91dedd965421d38a.jpg","title":"团山村_-_航拍_-_2025-05-04_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%9B%A2%E5%B1%B1%E6%9D%91_-_%E8%88%AA%E6%8B%8D_-_2025-05-04_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/%E5%9B%A2%E5%B1%B1%E6%9D%91_-_%E8%88%AA%E6%8B%8D_-_2025-05-04_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​团山村航拍","width":320,"height":180,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"团山村"}}